            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 21.3 Amount and Payment of Benefit. An eligible employee's total lump sum or income continuation benefit shall equal one (1) week of pay (i.e., forty (40) hours at the employee's base salary, but excluding any shift differentials or other premiums) for each full year of Company service as of the employee's layoff date, subject to a maximum benefit of 26 weeks of pay. Eligible employees may elect either of the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
                77,
                73,
                712,
                172
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 0,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    77.0,
