        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 21.5 Continuation of Medical Coverage. In the event of layoff, medical coverage for employees and dependents will continue until the employee is covered by any other group medical plan either as an employee or as a dependent, but in no event beyond three (3) months after the date of layoff. Required contributions, if any, must be paid during any period of such continuation of coverage.",
